    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="11.20.10"></a>11-20.10<br />Title and Authority</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff11/Flagstaff1120010.html#11.20.10.010">11-20.10.010</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Title and Authority</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff11/Flagstaff1120010.html#11.20.10.020">11-20.10.020</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Short Title</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="11.20.10.010"><a name="11.20.10.010">11-20.10.010</a> Title and Authority</h3>
            <p class="P0">These regulations shall be known and referred to as the Subdivision and Land Split Regulations for the City of Flagstaff, Arizona, as provided for by A.R.S. Section <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-463" target="_parent">9-463</a>. (Ord. 2024-28 (Res. 2024-45), Amended, 12/03/2024)</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="11.20.10.020"><a name="11.20.10.020">11-20.10.020</a> Short Title</h3>
            <p class="P0">The City of Flagstaff Subdivision and Land Split Regulations shall also be known as the &quot;Subdivision Regulations.&quot; (Ord. 2024-28 (Res. 2024-45), Amended, 12/03/2024)</p>

    </div>
